        },
        {
          "type": "caption",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I had planned to extend the sun life-cycle theme from the Game Map project in ‘Graphic Design 2’, but course instructor "
            },
            {
              "type": "external-link",
              "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/chris-lange-584b0b5/",
              "label": "Chris Lange"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": " noted that this direction would leave the site with one data point: time until the sun expands, sheds its outer layers, cools, and becomes a black dwarf. The brief required a broader resource, so I pivoted to a full planetary archive."
            }
          ]
        }
